{"server":"cn","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_02_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_02","title":"不幸重逢","storyCode":"FC-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"0c1c920f73d183859631d315654ac8d642bb906b6181ddd87124b54952a9347b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"随商队寻找深池部队踪迹的风笛和陈制止了塔拉流民打劫，苇草说明自己也同样在追踪深池之后，风笛和陈表示愿意帮助她。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些该死的塔拉人！真倒霉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"砍！用力砍！给他们点教训！告诉他们别想再伸手拿别人的东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"说得好，给塔拉人一点教训！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"听到没有，你们这些渣滓？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......手臂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......你敢说，我们塔拉人......该死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......打啊，我们打死这些做生意的！看看是谁该死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎么就用刀鞘砸？我可是给你们付了钱的，给我认真一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一柄刀鞘够用。你们再动手，我会连你们一起拦下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我和风笛只是和你们同行，不是你雇的保镖，别认错了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你和那边拿矛的家伙一样，也是个怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们之前听说的消息是真的，一般的商队，不敢来这个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那个领头的......你这身衣服，很惹眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走，陈小姐，我们得走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎么突然害怕了？我听到你这张嘴，刚刚还说要教训一下塔拉人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"深池......鬼魂部队，你们这些疯子！果然塔拉人多的地方，就会撞见这些鬼魂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，别说惹了我们，只是看到我们的样貌，都是会被杀人灭口的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟朋友追查了这么久，对那支鬼魂部队该有的样子，还是心里有数的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，请带着商队尽快离开。这里的流寇，我和风笛拦住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后追查深池部队的事，我们自己去，不必再麻烦你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队首领","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......唉，真倒霉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还想追？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，塞尔蒙，想想办法！我们得追上去弄死这些人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅是物资的事......他们跑掉之后，一定会把事情报给警察，还有那些当兵的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还用得着你说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚，凭你们的武力，越不过我的剑。所以刚才，你想虚张声势，吓退我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们现在怎么办？你总该有办法吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难怪即使这身打扮会给你带来危险，你却仍选择这样穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想当这支队伍的“领袖”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是轻轻地撞一下，应该只会头晕一会儿。我救人质的时候试过好几次了，不会出错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，昏过去了。是不是我太用力了？还是说，你们难道已经几天没吃饱饭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......可是，抢劫也是不对的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——别想偷袭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"长枪从身后挥来的瞬间，风笛本能地出手格挡。\n双方各退一步。看清对方后，风笛睁大了眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——苇草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的伤好了？没关系了？你怎么在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不对不对，你也是来抢劫的吗？那我就不能放你过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，是我没来得及阻止他们动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，无论如何，我不想让他们受伤......也不想让他们被抓捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那我们要做的事情差不多呀，你不用这么戒备地盯着我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论作为维多利亚的军人，还是罗德岛干员，我们都不可能伤害平民。我和陈陈都是来劝架的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，不过，不好意思，我的力气可能对普通人来说有点大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不我帮你把这些昏倒的人背到阴凉处休息吧？他们是住在这座村庄吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请你，离开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冲突已经化解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话是这么说，可我还是想帮帮忙呀。看起来，你好像有什么顾忌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧，你还是不喜欢说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在罗德岛的时候，他们就不许我探望你，也不肯告诉我为什么。我只能猜，是不是你不愿意想起小丘郡的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是你怎么跑到这里来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，看起来还像是在荒野里迷路了好多天一样。你的任务是什么呀，要不要我和陈陈陪你一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，想问你的事情太多啦，我的脑子都有些乱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，没关系。我只是，偶然被这些人邀请......护送他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，我一个人在野外行动了很长时间，荒野上的危险，对我来说不算什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也不是在为罗德岛执行任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在追踪与深池相关的一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪......我和陈陈也是，所以我们才会在这里撞见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在小丘郡的时候，你都受了那么重的伤，一定也很在意深池......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池里，有人改变了我的命运，所以我想......试试还能不能从那里扳回来什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是缓解他们带去的痛苦，还是让我自己感到平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们跟着商队往这个方向走，原本就是想找一支最近出现在附近的深池部队。也不知道为什么，看到你的时候，我真的吓了一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，你们跟深池一点关系都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，我去和陈陈说一说，任务先缓几天。她一定也很愿意帮助这些人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜，刚刚我是在几个人的盯梢下走进这间会客室的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对你要如何在塔拉人和维多利亚人之间表演不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我实在应该感谢你特意赶来特伦特郡吸引视线。我以为，你会在军队中隐藏更长时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领袖的计划走到这一步，我是威灵顿公爵的近卫队成员，还是深池的军官，这两个身份已经没有什么区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然监视你的是开斯特的人，那他们应该早就掌握了这一情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市外不断出现小股深池部队，还有深池大军经过的传言......这些就是做给他们看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上一些神神秘秘的贸易订单，现在恐怕连八卦一些的商人都已经知道，那位铁公爵对这座城市有所图谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都在四处打探，拼命猜测，那位公爵想借特伦特郡的舞台做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很符合领袖的期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，如果我们真正的目的地被过早发现，各位公爵提前知道了领袖的决心，恐怕橡林郡外也会像伦蒂尼姆一样热闹吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，他们是更怕萨卡兹，还是更怕塔拉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把塔拉人和魔族相提并论？你没资格开这种玩笑，维多利亚的菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听说“间谍”死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，从那以后，我们能得到的伦蒂尼姆城内的情报就大幅度减少了，确实可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里不仅有萨卡兹，还蛰伏着一些......挺有意思的势力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就说过，你的感情用事一定会毁掉你的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感情用事？会这样想我的人可真是不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该想着给蔓德拉找一条生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被“雄辩家”利用，试图分裂深池，本该和那六个叛徒一同死在小丘郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉是“间谍”最信任的人，在确定“间谍”是否会背叛之前，处决她可算不上什么明智之选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救援“间谍”的任务，哪怕不值得你我亲自去，也应该换一个更稳妥的人去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这么说，我和你关系不睦，没机会害死你，这对你来说不是个好消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无意义的油嘴滑舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在公爵大人和领袖做出最终决定之前，你可不能轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能看出伦蒂尼姆情报的重要性，我怎么会看不出呢。可我们最终会不会向伦蒂尼姆进军，现在还是未知数呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取决于公爵之间的合作进展？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不然我现在是在为什么奔走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。我还记得四年前在飞地上的那场战役，我们是怎么苦苦等待大贵族们的合作结果的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与此同时，心思各异的使者在几千公里外来回周旋，耐心地拉扯数周，只为了跟公爵说上一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮，你最好是站在领袖这边的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉已死，你想帮她的小心思我可以不再追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那个人还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你是说亲爱的可怜的拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雄辩家”在小丘郡的阴谋不能再重演。只要她活着一天，对深池与领袖的威胁就始终存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领袖把掌控她行踪的任务交给了你。别再让私情影响你，阿赫茉妮。你失败不了太多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你对一名职业间谍的感情生活真是怀抱着太多幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，别恶狠狠地盯着我了，“校官”大人，除非你想帮我化妆。我还有一场宴会要去呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是不错的嘛，维恩，就跟那时候一样。我总以为你没什么本事，结果你每次都能办成一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，借来这点口粮，又能顶什么用呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两个人，应该是维多利亚人吧？她们说了，能去城镇替我们把用不着的东西换出去，也能给你们弄到防身的棍棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有像样的武器，你不该感到高兴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，拿你的小收音机听听，广播里有没有商队被打劫的事情。说不定那些胆小鬼怕被深池报复，根本没敢报警......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，维恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在回头张望什么呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那几个感染者，从村子出来后就一直远远地跟着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还跟着啊？我们走得这么快，以那几个病人的腿脚，还带着小孩，居然还能追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他们要跟上我们，多不容易啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我在担心莫兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的眼睛在几年前那次饥荒里就坏了，夜里看不见路。现在敲过了熄火钟，路上连一盏灯都不剩下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，听起来还挺可怜。那请问他们跟着我们做什么？难道我们看起来像是什么救援队吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，呃，可能是因为你这身衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧，除了我以外，其他人都是把你当成真正的深池来对待的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都知道，深池会对塔拉人好，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，去找他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你吓我一跳......你的声音怎么在发抖？你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有更多人轮流站岗放哨，不是坏事......我们躲避巡逻队会更容易一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......带上他们一起走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
